      "category": "defensive",
      "text": "Villamor Koth's foes struggle to pass his defenses. He isn't Off-Guard to Hidden, Undetected, or flanking creatures of his level or lower, or to creatures of his level or lower using surprise attack. However, these creatures can still help their allies flank.",
