    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Knockback",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "rage"
      ],
      "text": "Requirements Villamor Koth's last action was a successful Strike.\n\n---\n\nEffect Villamor Koth pushes his foe back 5 feet, with the effects of a successful Shove. He can follow the foe as normal for a successful shove."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Rage",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Villamor begins raging. He gains 19 temporary Hit Points. This frenzy lasts for 1 minute, until there are no enemies he can perceive, or until he falls Unconscious, whichever comes first. He can't voluntarily stop raging. While he is raging, he deals 12 additional Damage with melee weapons and unarmed attacks. This additional damage is halved if his weapon or unarmed attack is agile. While raging, Villamor Koth's AC is 33.",
